		{
			"id": "nWiV-9-Ou6XeFXm4a",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 6, DX 13, IQ 4, HT 10, HP 6, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 10, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 11, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
