		{
			"id": "nJo3tLCNIuJC9A6jH",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 17 (offense 23, protection -6), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1RcAeYwHfgSYZfz7",
			"text": "Swarming Bites: No attack roll and no active defense. Swarming Bites: 1d-3 cutting, Reach C. No attack roll and no defence. The bites are minor; the swarm's real effect is that anyone inside it is blinded, buffeted and unable to hold a line."
		},
