		{
			"id": "nkY1ADKg52STBnhui",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Swarm of Bats (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nWBu_Xsgfp35RZHPz",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nj8k1Q3RZrjp2SAcY",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 3 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1jkkrYQFIhAV8mzn",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5; air Move 11, 16 at a sprint (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nAsOW2UiqNdT4lWi0",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nD016QZgtT0VMnMTx",
			"text": "One hex of swarm; the individual bat is the Bat record in the bird-fish-aquatic batch."
		},
		{
			"id": "nv-UqqetjK6henG4H",
			"text": "Sonar is why a light does nothing to it. Darkness is not this creature's problem."
		},
		{
